    "description": "Wrote a bench test automation software platform in Python for SerDes Validation team.  This included drivers for bench equipment using GPIB, Serial, USB and TCP/IP interfaces.  Wrote and support a sophisticated jitter tolerance automation script among many other Python test scripts used throughout LSI for automated high-speed SerDes testing.  Formed a SerDes Software team to write GUI software used for bench and customer testing of LSI high speed SerDes.  GUI software from this team is used for SerDes test and debugging throughout LSI and at most customers who use LSI high speed SerDes.\nManage the Network SerDes Applications Engineering team.  The team works with all of LSI’s Networking customers using high-speed SerDes.  The team provides recommended register settings and works with customers to optimize settings for their applications.  Provides SerDes validation testing reports and other requested documentation and provides expert assistance for bringup and debugging of SerDes. The Applications team also works with the Validation team to complete SerDes bench testing required by customers and works with the Sales team to setup and perform SerDes demonstrations for potential customers.",
